        You have been successfully unsubscribed from future emails.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        You will no longer receive property listing emails from us.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6">
        <%= link_to 'Return to Home', root_path, class: 'inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-md shadow-sm text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700' %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

